 gui-agent/vchan.c                          |  17 +-
 gui-agent/vchan.h                          |   7 +-
 vs2022/gui-agent/gui-agent.vcxproj         |   2 +
 vs2022/gui-agent/gui-agent.vcxproj.filters |   6 +
 9 files changed, 484 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
